.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/
**/doc/api/
.widget_preview/
migrate_working_dir/

# Código generado (build_runner, freezed, json_serializable, etc.)
